  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1089771/description_8fa99ea6-0556-47ca-afb6-dc15c909822e.png\" alt=\"木劍\" width=\"18\" height=\"225\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;color:#808080\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1089771/description_444d11e6-9e81-42e3-8f67-bbfa16fa006c.png\" alt=\"石劍\" width=\"34\" height=\"225\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;color:#808080\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1089771/description_79af1311-6666-4dd4-9464-488fa1a4defb.png\" alt=\"鐵劍\" width=\"75\" height=\"225\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;color:#808080\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1089771/description_444914bf-b681-48c5-97e1-6221f26e3a7e.png\" alt=\"金劍\" width=\"82\" height=\"225\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;color:#808080\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1089771/description_ea8d133f-5698-4ca2-a7dd-60a4f6499152.png\" alt=\"鑽石劍\" width=\"80\" height=\"225\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;color:#808080\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1089771/description_ee052e30-10f3-4f17-b964-d89a389620f4.png\" alt=\"獄髓劍\" width=\"81\" height=\"225\"></p>\n<p>我受到《Hytale》中精緻的 3D 武器模型啟發。因此，我嘗試製作了一些風格類似的武器模型。我絕非專業藝術家，但我一直不喜歡《Minecraft》中武器總是緊貼玩家的設計。</p>\n<p>模型本身並非極度精緻，但紋理細節稍多，因此可能更適合搭配 32x 或 64x 材質包，當然您也可以隨心所欲地使用它們！</p>\n<p>我的目標是再製作幾套包含工具的材質包，並加入對部分模組的支援，採用相同的風格。</p>",
